            "notes": "## Items\n\n[Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) is the key. This essentially makes you 10% more tanky as long as you have shields or armor (1.1x your HP). It also means that whenever you are healing yourself with [Inner Peace], and you're healing shields or armor, it is 10% more valuable. If you are going against a lot of AP enemies, then you can do the same by just getting [Reinforced Titanium] (or both). The alternative is [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1), which got buffed a lot. This should be bought whenever there's spare money or instead of [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) when ahead.\n\nFor our damage item, we take [Codebreaker] in most rounds with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09)(or another counterpick item from below). [Orb of Perception] is another good alternative. If you have a lot of money, then taking [Eye of the Spider] is great too.\n\n## Counterpick Options\n\n[Iron Eyes](item_f16d03a7-f20e-4a1d-a1f6-55863e163c03) VS heroes that like to headshot, like Kiri, Cass, Soldier, Genji (melee is crit if they play the item), Ashe (WP), Ana (Crit Power), JQ (WP), or Zen. The more I play, the more I value it because Zen is so easy to headshot.\n\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) vs. DoT (Damage over Time) and debuffs such as Ashe, Ana, JQ, Mei, Moira, and Junkrat (burn Power). There are some other debuffs and slows where it\u2019s still useful, mostly from items or powers.\n\n[Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182) is a very solid item overall. Many heroes are in the air, such as Freja, Mercy, DVA, Pharah, Juno, Winston, or Genji. Stats are exactly what we want with some HP and damage.",
