            "notes": "## Powers\n\nIf you aren't dying [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) is great. It's particularly powerful against non-tanky enemies and enemies that are easy to headshot like an Ashe, Zen, Cass, Winton or Orisa because they explode.\n\n[Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) is really good to generate money and helps with full healing tanks. This is very powerful if you can easily farm ult onto some tank like Rein, Orisa, DVA or Winton.\n\nThen lastly, if you are dying to a particular hero, you can go [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) to give you more surivability.\n\n## Items\n\nIt's [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) in most games or [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121). [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is more aggressive and spammy. Alternatives are [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) or [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf). [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) should ALWAYS be picked if enough cash.\n\nUpgrade [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) for  [Emergency Chip](item_c73e060f-94df-4e6b-bb6d-fe2f65e31dd1) if enough money.",
