            "notes": "## Items\n\nAt this rate, we need more damage with [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) and [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27). You can pick more defensive items as well if needed.\n\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) is another good option.\n\nReplace [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) with [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) if you have enough cash.\n\nYou can also run [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) and keep [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) instead of [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27), you have to kinda see what fits best.",
