            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:00:03.131994+00:00",
            "notes": "## Power  \n\n[Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) allows you to trans your team/tank and still potentially get another ult in the same fight. It also makes you harder to kill.  \n\n[Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) is still very useful, and so is [Discord Inferno](item_cf48f92d-a1d1-420a-b0e3-01ed290faa62) if you feel like you need more damage.  \n\n## Items  \n\nThis late into the game, you mostly have to decide on your own what you want to play.  \n\nFor more defensive options, you can play [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) or [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8). Usually, [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d) is better because it\u2019s armor, and many of the stronger, more annoying heroes deal a lot of small damage, like Tracer, Winston, Moira, Zarya, Soldier, or Genji.  \n\nFor more offensive options, a full loadout would be something like this:  \n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b)  \n- [Orb of Perception](item_762bf2a4-c062-4dfd-b8e0-47e37ba1cadf)  \n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)  \n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c)  \n- [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121)  \n- [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)",
